          <stack class="ds ds-inline siteterms-1j">
            <text class="ds ds-text" value="TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY UAE LAW, DESPIA’S TOTAL LIABILITY FOR ALL CLAIMS ARISING FROM THE SERVICES SHALL NOT EXCEED THE GREATER OF: (A) THE FEES YOU PAID TO DESPIA IN THE 12 MONTHS BEFORE THE CLAIM, OR (B) USD $100."/>
          </stack>
          <stack class="ds ds-inline siteterms-1k">
            <text class="ds ds-text" value="DESPIA SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, INCLUDING LOSS OF PROFITS, REVENUE, DATA, GOODWILL, OR BUSINESS OPPORTUNITIES, REGARDLESS OF THE THEORY OF LIABILITY, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES."/>
          </stack>
          <stack class="ds ds-inline">
            <text class="ds ds-text" value="This does not affect any rights that cannot be limited under applicable UAE law."/>
          </stack>
        </stack>
        <stack class="ds siteterms-1l">
          <stack class="ds ds-inline siteterms-1m">
            <text class="ds ds-text" value="Indemnification"/>
          </stack>
          <stack class="ds ds-inline siteterms-1n">
            <text class="ds ds-text" value="You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Despia, its officers, directors, employees, and agents from any claims, damages, losses, costs, or expenses (including legal fees) arising from: your use of the Services; your applications and their content, data, or functionality; any violation of these Terms or applicable law, including UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 34 of 2021 and UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021; any infringement of third-party rights including intellectual property, privacy, or publicity rights; and any claims from end users of your applications or any third party."/>
          </stack>
        </stack>
        <stack class="ds siteterms-1o">
          <stack class="ds ds-inline siteterms-1p">
            <text class="ds ds-text" value="Termination"/>
          </stack>
          <stack class="ds ds-inline siteterms-1q">
            <text class="ds ds-text" value="We may suspend or terminate your account for Terms violations, legal requirements, or platform safety. You can close your account anytime. Because Despia does not host your application or end-user data, termination affects your access to the build and deployment tools only. Your application, code, and data remain on your own infrastructure."/>
          </stack>
          <stack class="ds ds-inline siteterms-1r">
            <text class="ds ds-text" value="Upon termination, Despia will delete your account data and any app-related data (store metadata, icons, build configurations) within a commercially reasonable period. Encrypted credentials will be destroyed. Sections relating to liability, indemnification, intellectual property, disclaimers, and dispute resolution survive termination."/>
          </stack>
        </stack>
        <stack class="ds siteterms-1s">
          <stack class="ds ds-inline siteterms-1t">
            <text class="ds ds-text" value="Disputes"/>
